---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Shipping Policy - LEEYOUNG" description="Learn about our shipping methods, delivery times, and coverage areas">
  <Header />

  <main class="policy-page">
    <div class="policy-container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span>Shipping Policy</span>
      </nav>

      <h1 class="policy-title">Shipping Policy</h1>

      <div class="policy-content">
        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>I. Delivery Service Coverage</h2>

          <h3>1. Supported Areas:</h3>
          <p>Contiguous 48 U.S. states (excluding remote areas of Alaska, Hawaii, and U.S. territories).</p>

          <h3>2. Excluded Regions:</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Remote areas of Alaska and Hawaii (specific ZIP codes available upon request).</li>
            <li>U.S. territories and freely associated states: Puerto Rico, Guam, U.S. Virgin Islands, American Samoa, Northern Mariana Islands.</li>
            <li>International affiliated states: Palau, Federated States of Micronesia, Marshall Islands (excluded due to customs restrictions).</li>
            <li>Military addresses.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>II. Shipping Methods & Timelines</h2>

          <p><strong>Free Shipping (All Orders):</strong> Cost is $0 USD on every order—there is no minimum purchase requirement or item‑count threshold.</p>

          <h3>1. Standard Shipping</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Delivery time:</strong> 1-3 business days (contiguous 48 states only).</li>
            <li><strong>Cost:</strong> Free.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>III. Order Processing & Tracking</h2>

          <h3>1. Order Processing:</h3>
          <p>All orders are processed within 1-3 business days.</p>

          <h3>2. Tracking Information:</h3>
          <p>A tracking number will be emailed upon shipment. Real-time updates are available via carrier websites (e.g., USPS, FedEx).</p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>IV. International Shipping & Customs</h2>

          <h3>1. International Orders:</h3>
          <p>We do not directly ship internationally. If using a third-party forwarding service:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Customs duties, taxes, or fees are the recipient's responsibility.</li>
            <li>Delays or returns due to customs inspections are not our liability.</li>
          </ul>

          <h3>2. Self-Forwarding Risks:</h3>
          <p>Forwarding goods to excluded regions (e.g., Puerto Rico, military bases) is prohibited. Any related losses are the customer's responsibility.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>V. Liability Disclaimer</h2>

          <h3>1. Address Accuracy:</h3>
          <p>We are not liable for reshipment or refunds due to incorrect, incomplete, or excluded addresses.</p>

          <h3>2. Force Majeure:</h3>
          <p>Delays or losses caused by extreme weather, war, strikes, customs policy changes, or other uncontrollable events are not our responsibility.</p>

          <h3>3. Transfer of Risk:</h3>
          <p>Damage or loss during transit becomes the carrier's or customer's responsibility once the package is marked "delivered."</p>

          <h3>4. Policy Updates:</h3>
          <p>We reserve the right to modify shipping policies and coverage without prior notice.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>VI. Returns & Dispute Resolution</h2>

          <h3>1. Damaged/Incorrect Items:</h3>
          <p>Contact us within 7 days of delivery with photos and order number for replacements or refunds (no exceptions after this period).</p>

          <h3>2. Delivery Delays:</h3>
          <p>If tracking shows "delivered" but the package is missing, contact your local post office or carrier first.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>VII. Important Notes</h2>

          <h3>1. Address Validation:</h3>
          <p>Checkout includes an automated system to block orders from excluded regions (e.g., alerts for "APO" or "Hawaii" addresses).</p>

          <h3>2. Policy Accessibility:</h3>
          <p>Full terms are available under "Shipping Policy" at the bottom of our website. Placing an order implies acceptance of these terms.</p>
        </section>

        <div class="policy-notice">
          <h3>Important Notice:</h3>
          <p>Due to logistics partnerships and regional policies, we currently do not ship to Alaska, Hawaii, U.S. territories, or military bases. Risks from forwarding goods to these areas are solely the customer's responsibility.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-contact">
          <h3>Questions?</h3>
          <p>If you have any questions about our shipping policy, please contact us at:</p>
          <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:customerservice@leeyoungshop.com">customerservice@leeyoungshop.com</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .policy-page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: #fafafa;
    padding: 100px 0 4rem;
  }

  .policy-container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #666;
  }

  .breadcrumb a {
    color: #666;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }

  .breadcrumb a:hover {
    color: #000;
  }

  .breadcrumb span {
    color: #999;
  }

  .policy-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #000;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .policy-content {
    background: #fff;
    padding: 3rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }

  .policy-section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
  }

  .policy-section:last-of-type {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .policy-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #000;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .policy-section h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #000;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .policy-section p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #333;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .policy-section ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 2rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  .policy-section li {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #333;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .policy-notice {
    background: #fffbf0;
    border-left: 4px solid #d4af37;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .policy-notice h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #000;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .policy-notice p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #666;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .policy-contact {
    background: #f8f8f8;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .policy-contact h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #000;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .policy-contact p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .policy-contact a {
    color: #d4af37;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .policy-contact a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .policy-page {
      padding: 80px 0 3rem;
    }

    .policy-container {
      padding: 0 1.5rem;
    }

    .policy-content {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .policy-title {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
    }

    .policy-section h2 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
    }

    .policy-section h3 {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
